(a): The share of micro and small enterprises in total industrial production region-wise is not maintained centrally. However, at all India level, the share of the micro and small enterprise sector in the total manufacturing output during 2005-06, 2006-07 and 2007-08 (latest available) was estimated to 45.76%, 45.62% and 45.24% respectively.
